            We did not taste-test or lab-test these products. Comments on taste and mixing reflect the brand's directions, how the protein types behave in heat, and the general pattern of buyer reviews, not our own trials. We excluded products that the heavy-metals guide flags as avoid or limit, store-exclusive items not sold on Amazon, and cocoa mixes that add only a few grams of protein while being marketed as high-protein.
